\item[S2] Michel Waldschmidt, \emph{Open Diophantine Problems}, arXiv:math/0312440v2 (24 January 2004), Conjecture 4.21 and immediately preceding definitions, p.44. \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/math/0312440v2}.
